sting. A better approach might be to show TG's gate values at initialization versus final training, UG's final gates, and how TG's gates evolve across training steps. I should follow the user's request closely and note that PCGrad data isn't available, though I could check the local JSONL logs to see if I can extract the PCGrad gate profiles.",
